Hi Olga,

Thank you very much for taking the time to go over the annotation file. This was a dumb oversight on my end. I'm sorry.

I adjusted the annotation file, and now the fitted models look like this: ABUNDANCE ~ GROUP + (1 | SUBJECT).

This is more of a statistical question, but shouldn't the model include something like this: (1 | TIME.POINT)?

Best,
Luiz

